    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seven years ago, my grandmother said she would climb this mountain \u2014 and never returned.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mount Lomyst</i> is a 2D platformer without jumping, where you climb using a grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your missing grandmother\u2019s trail and ascend to the summit of Mount Lomyst.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D platformer without jumping!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories of your grandmother become clearer as you climb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and stylized art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2\u20133 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear story</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seven years ago, my grandmother said she would climb this mountain \u2014 and never returned.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mount Lomyst</i> is a 2D platformer without jumping, where you climb using a grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your missing grandmother\u2019s trail and ascend to the summit of Mount Lomyst.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D platformer without jumping!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories of your grandmother become clearer as you climb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and stylized art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2\u20133 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear story</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mount Lomyst is a 2D action game about climbing to the summit of Mount Lomyst, using a grappling hook and wall climbing \u2014 without jumping.",
